#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:101
#: a16a0e96028245069214c27b7715e765
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf7.rst:103
#: 65376f04f93143599a334008d9daf013
msgid "All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1/2, and 3/4."
msgstr ""

